<title>ALBANIA: Albania appoints new central bank governor.</title>
<headline>Albania appoints new central bank governor.</headline>
<dateline>TIRANA 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>President Sali Berisha has signed a decree appointing Qamil Tusha as the new governor of the Bank of Albania, presidency spokeswoman Linda Ihsani told Reuters.</p>
</text>
